# Notes:
# - Be careful: some plugin binaries (Assets/Plugins/*.dll, *.so etc.) may need to be tracked.
#   Adjust the binary patterns above to allow checked-in plugin binaries (e.g. add !Assets/Plugins/**/*.dll).